{"seq":3,"slug":"complexity-science","title":"复杂性科学","stage":"DONE","category":"systems-thinking","chapterCount":3,"docCount":11,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/complexity-science","rating":{"composite":3.65,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.28,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"复杂性科学-简介\">复杂性科学 简介</h1><p>复杂性科学研究由大量相互作用的组分构成的系统如何产生整体层面的秩序、模式和行为。从蚁群的协调觅食到股市的价格波动，从大脑神经元的协同活动到互联网的自发演化，复杂性科学揭示了这些看似无关现象背后共同的底层规律。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向对复杂现象感兴趣的技术从业者和跨学科学习者。你不需要物理学或生物学的专业背景，但对非线性关系、涌现现象和自适应行为的好奇心将帮助你更深入地理解内容。具备系统思维基础和基本的数学直觉将使学习更加高效。</p>\n<p>全书共分三章，分别从三个核心视角展开复杂性科学的知识体系。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>涌现与自组织</strong>探讨复杂系统最引人入胜的特征——没有中央指挥，局部的简单交互如何产生全局的复杂秩序。从涌现的基本概念到群体智能和元胞自动机，你将理解为什么整体可以大于部分之和。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>混沌与非线性</strong>深入复杂系统中确定性与不可预测性并存的奇妙世界。混沌理论表明，即使完全确定的规则也能产生看似随机的行为。你将通过奇异吸引子、分形和蝴蝶效应理解非线性系统的本质特征。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>适应性系统</strong>聚焦于能够学习、演化和适应环境变化的系统。复杂适应系统是复杂性科学中与工程实践关联最紧密的领域，软件生态系统、技术社区和商业组织都可以被理解为复杂适应系统。</p>\n<p>推荐按章节顺序阅读。涌现与自组织是理解复杂性的入门，混沌与非线性提供了理解不可预测性的数学直觉，适应性系统则将理论与实践连接起来。如果你的兴趣偏向工程应用，可以在阅读完第一章后直接跳到第三章。对于热衷数学美感的读者，第二章的内容尤其值得深入探索。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"emergence-and-self-organization","title":"涌现与自组织","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/complexity-science/emergence-and-self-organization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"emergence-fundamentals","title":"涌现基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/complexity-science/emergence-and-self-organization/emergence-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"self-organization","title":"自组织","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/complexity-science/emergence-and-self-organization/self-organization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"swarm-intelligence","title":"群体智能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/complexity-science/emergence-and-self-organization/swarm-intelligence"},{"seq":4,"slug":"cellular-automata","title":"元胞自动机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/complexity-science/emergence-and-self-organization/cellular-automata"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"chaos-and-nonlinear","title":"混沌与非线性","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/complexity-science/chaos-and-nonlinear","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"chaos-theory","title":"混沌理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/complexity-science/chaos-and-nonlinear/chaos-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"strange-attractors","title":"奇异吸引子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/complexity-science/chaos-and-nonlinear/strange-attractors"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fractals","title":"分形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/complexity-science/chaos-and-nonlinear/fractals"},{"seq":4,"slug":"butterfly-effect","title":"蝴蝶效应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/complexity-science/chaos-and-nonlinear/butterfly-effect"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"adaptive-systems","title":"适应性系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/complexity-science/adaptive-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"complex-adaptive-systems","title":"复杂自适应系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/complexity-science/adaptive-systems/complex-adaptive-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fitness-landscapes","title":"适应性景观","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/complexity-science/adaptive-systems/fitness-landscapes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"evolution-and-adaptation","title":"演化与适应机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/systems-thinking/complexity-science/adaptive-systems/evolution-and-adaptation"}]}]}